note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note Pure seeded OM-2 implementation of Program Identity v2 (spec/program-identity.md)
note covering all 5 gates: BODY_BOUND, REPRESENTATION_INVARIANT (incl. 400-chain
note seeded associativity), MUTATION_SEPARATION (3000-program differential + 2000x8
note single mutations), LIBRARY_REGRESSION (library/DAG/corpus/discovery/refactor/
note VC-bridge/triple-id/64-step), and VISOR_REGRESSION.
om2

